{% if entry.version == "v0.1.0" %}
### Release status

v0.1.0 is the core's first slice, cut before the comparator gates (docs/roadmap.md). It has **not** cleared the three gates of org golden rule 6 (a fidelity sheet from its source, the per-PR delivery smoke, and an anchor reproducing the source's own trend): no result from this release counts as a benchmark number. It ships `core/` (MIT OR GPL-2.0-only, with `core/LICENSE`) and `docs/`, as they stand on `main` at the release commit.

